# Female character sheet (GandalfHardcore pack), sliced into one bank per
# column. A 12-column by 14-row grid of 64x64 cells: row 0 is portraits, rows
# 1..13 each character's cycle (one facing; the world view flips it). Columns 0
# through 8 are the standing characters, column 9 a winged demon, column 11 a
# red-haired woman in a white gown. Column 10 holds a bare reclining figure and
# is left out. Names are best-effort from the pack list (bar lady, nun, knight,
# dryad, queen, succubus, vampire, merchant, maid).

sheet female.ppm
cell 64 64

bank FEMALE_QUEEN
seq IDLE loop ticks=4 : col 0 rows 1-13

bank FEMALE_DRYAD
seq IDLE loop ticks=4 : col 1 rows 1-13

bank FEMALE_NUN
seq IDLE loop ticks=4 : col 2 rows 1-13

bank FEMALE_BARLADY
seq IDLE loop ticks=4 : col 3 rows 1-13

bank FEMALE_MAID
seq IDLE loop ticks=4 : col 4 rows 1-13

bank FEMALE_KNIGHT
seq IDLE loop ticks=4 : col 5 rows 1-13

bank FEMALE_VAMPIRE
seq IDLE loop ticks=4 : col 6 rows 1-13

bank FEMALE_MERCHANT
seq IDLE loop ticks=4 : col 7 rows 1-13

bank FEMALE_SUCCUBUS
seq IDLE loop ticks=4 : col 8 rows 1-13

bank FEMALE_IMP
seq IDLE loop ticks=4 : col 9 rows 1-13

bank FEMALE_LADY
seq IDLE loop ticks=4 : col 11 rows 1-13
